#NEXUS

[ poole2022z_fig3: Ornithopod strict consensus, read at 600 dpi from the vector PDF. Polytomies: Lesothosaurus, Stormbergia and the rest; Shishugou taxon, (Agilisaurus, Hexinlusaurus) and the rest; the seven-branch node from Haya to the Hypsilophodon node; Trinisaura, Kangnasaurus and (Rhabdodontoidea, Dryomorpha); and Owenodon, Theiophytalia, Iguanacolossus and the rest. Iguanodontia, Rhabdodontoidea, Dryomorpha, Dryosauridae, Ankylopollexia, Styracosterna and Hadrosauroidea label dotted nodes and are kept; the colour highlights are not encoded. 69 tips, 5 polytomies (3, 3, 7, 3, 4 children); 7 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Sample 8 case (census 2, seed 20261251). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

